{
  "dqlnbVersion": 1,
  "version": 1,
  "metadata": {
    "title": "Jaffle Shop — Welcome",
    "description": "Explore the dbt marts and the two certified blocks shipped on this branch."
  },
  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Jaffle Shop + DQL\n\nThis `with-dql` branch adds a DQL workspace on top of the standard Jaffle Shop dbt project. The connection points at the dbt-built `jaffle_shop.duckdb`, the dbt DAG is synced, and there are two **certified blocks** plus a **Jaffle Analytics** App.\n\nRun the cells below, open **Blocks** and **Apps** in the left rail, then follow [`TUTORIAL.md`](../TUTORIAL.md) to build the rest yourself."
    },
    {
      "title": "Revenue by month (raw query)",
      "id": "revenue_raw",
      "type": "sql",
      "source": "SELECT date_trunc('month', ordered_at) AS month, SUM(order_total) AS revenue\nFROM dev.orders\nGROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1"
    },
    {
      "title": "Customer mix",
      "id": "customer_mix",
      "type": "sql",
      "source": "SELECT customer_type, COUNT(*) AS customers, SUM(lifetime_spend) AS lifetime_spend\nFROM dev.customers\nGROUP BY 1 ORDER BY lifetime_spend DESC"
    }
  ]
}
